IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ccc-core`
IMPORT `ccc9-support`
IMPORT `ccc9-sexual-assault`

-- ccc9-tests-sexual-assault.l4 -- tests for ss 271 to 275 and s 278. Expected values are written by hand from the text (line numbers of the text file beside them).
-- Fixture for the seam input s 787(1) (text line 16717): a fine of not more than $5,000 or imprisonment of not more than two years less a day, or both.
`s 271 test: the s 787(1) general penalty` MEANS Punishment OF `on summary conviction`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `two years less a day`), `no imprisonment is stated`, (`a fine of` 5000), `no fine is stated`

§ `s 271: sexual assault (lines 5063-5066)`

#ASSERT `s 271 the accused is guilty of the offence of sexual assault` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 271 the accused is guilty of the offence of sexual assault` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 271 the accused is guilty of the offence of sexual assault` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 271 the class of the offence` EQUALS `an offence that the section makes both indictable and punishable on summary conviction`
-- (a) indictable: not more than 10 years, or, if the complainant is under 16, not more than 14 years and a minimum of one year
#ASSERT `s 271 the punishment on the mode of proceeding` `by indictment` 30 EQUALS Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`), `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
#ASSERT `s 271 the punishment on the mode of proceeding` `by indictment` 16 EQUALS Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`), `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
#ASSERT `s 271 the punishment on the mode of proceeding` `by indictment` 15 EQUALS Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`), (`imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 1, 0, 0, FALSE)), `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
#ASSERT `s 271 the punishment on the mode of proceeding` `by indictment` 15.9 EQUALS Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`), (`imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 1, 0, 0, FALSE)), `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
#ASSERT `s 271 the punishment on the mode of proceeding` `by indictment` 6 EQUALS Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`), (`imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 1, 0, 0, FALSE)), `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
-- (b) summary conviction: not more than two years less a day, or, if the complainant is under 16, two years less a day and a minimum of six months
#ASSERT `s 271 the punishment on the mode of proceeding` `on summary conviction` 30 EQUALS Punishment OF `on summary conviction`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `two years less a day`), `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
#ASSERT `s 271 the punishment on the mode of proceeding` `on summary conviction` 16 EQUALS Punishment OF `on summary conviction`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `two years less a day`), `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
#ASSERT `s 271 the punishment on the mode of proceeding` `on summary conviction` 15 EQUALS Punishment OF `on summary conviction`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `two years less a day`), (`imprisonment for a term of` `six months`), `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`

§ `s 272(1): sexual assault with a weapon, threats to a third party or causing bodily harm (lines 5067-5073)`

-- Field order of `s 272(1) facts`: sexual assault, weapon (s 2), imitation, threat of bodily harm to another, bodily harm to complainant (s 2), chokes/suffocates/strangles, party with another
`s 272(1) test: weapon` MEANS `s 272(1) facts` OF (JUST TRUE), (JUST TRUE), FALSE, FALSE, (JUST FALSE), FALSE, FALSE
`s 272(1) test: imitation` MEANS `s 272(1) facts` OF (JUST TRUE), (JUST FALSE), TRUE, FALSE, (JUST FALSE), FALSE, FALSE
`s 272(1) test: threat to a third person` MEANS `s 272(1) facts` OF (JUST TRUE), (JUST FALSE), FALSE, TRUE, (JUST FALSE), FALSE, FALSE
`s 272(1) test: bodily harm` MEANS `s 272(1) facts` OF (JUST TRUE), (JUST FALSE), FALSE, FALSE, (JUST TRUE), FALSE, FALSE
`s 272(1) test: choking` MEANS `s 272(1) facts` OF (JUST TRUE), (JUST FALSE), FALSE, FALSE, (JUST FALSE), TRUE, FALSE
`s 272(1) test: party to the offence` MEANS `s 272(1) facts` OF (JUST TRUE), (JUST FALSE), FALSE, FALSE, (JUST FALSE), FALSE, TRUE
`s 272(1) test: plain sexual assault` MEANS `s 272(1) facts` OF (JUST TRUE), (JUST FALSE), FALSE, FALSE, (JUST FALSE), FALSE, FALSE
`s 272(1) test: no sexual assault` MEANS `s 272(1) facts` OF (JUST FALSE), (JUST TRUE), TRUE, TRUE, (JUST TRUE), TRUE, TRUE
`s 272(1) test: sexual assault not defined, weapon` MEANS `s 272(1) facts` OF NOTHING, (JUST TRUE), FALSE, FALSE, (JUST FALSE), FALSE, FALSE
`s 272(1) test: weapon not covered by s 2` MEANS `s 272(1) facts` OF (JUST TRUE), NOTHING, FALSE, FALSE, (JUST FALSE), FALSE, FALSE
