#ASSERT `s 272(1)(c.1) the accused, in committing a sexual assault, chokes, suffocates or strangles the complainant` `s 272(1) test: choking` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 272(1)(c.1) the accused, in committing a sexual assault, chokes, suffocates or strangles the complainant` `s 272(1) test: plain sexual assault` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 272(1)(d) the accused, in committing a sexual assault, is a party to the offence with any other person` `s 272(1) test: party to the offence` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 272(1)(d) the accused, in committing a sexual assault, is a party to the offence with any other person` `s 272(1) test: plain sexual assault` EQUALS JUST FALSE
