#ASSERT `s 272(1) the accused commits the offence of sexual assault with a weapon, threats to a third party or causing bodily harm` `s 272(1) test: imitation` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 272(1) the accused commits the offence of sexual assault with a weapon, threats to a third party or causing bodily harm` `s 272(1) test: threat to a third person` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 272(1) the accused commits the offence of sexual assault with a weapon, threats to a third party or causing bodily harm` `s 272(1) test: bodily harm` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 272(1) the accused commits the offence of sexual assault with a weapon, threats to a third party or causing bodily harm` `s 272(1) test: choking` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 272(1) the accused commits the offence of sexual assault with a weapon, threats to a third party or causing bodily harm` `s 272(1) test: party to the offence` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 272(1) the accused commits the offence of sexual assault with a weapon, threats to a third party or causing bodily harm` `s 272(1) test: plain sexual assault` EQUALS JUST FALSE
