§ `s 272(2): the limbs of the punishment (lines 5074-5081)`

-- Field order of `s 272(2) facts`: restricted firearm (s 2.1), prohibited firearm (s 2.1), any firearm (s 2), criminal organization (s 2), second or subsequent (subsection (3)), complainant's age
`s 272(2) test: restricted firearm, first offence, adult` MEANS `s 272(2) facts` OF (JUST TRUE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST TRUE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), 30
`s 272(2) test: prohibited firearm, subsequent offence, adult` MEANS `s 272(2) facts` OF (JUST FALSE), (JUST TRUE), (JUST TRUE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST TRUE), 30
`s 272(2) test: other firearm for a criminal organization, first offence` MEANS `s 272(2) facts` OF (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST TRUE), (JUST TRUE), (JUST FALSE), 30
`s 272(2) test: other firearm, no organization, adult` MEANS `s 272(2) facts` OF (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST TRUE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), 30
`s 272(2) test: no firearm, complainant 15` MEANS `s 272(2) facts` OF (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), 15
`s 272(2) test: no firearm, complainant 16` MEANS `s 272(2) facts` OF (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), 16
`s 272(2) test: restricted firearm, complainant 15` MEANS `s 272(2) facts` OF (JUST TRUE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST TRUE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), 15
`s 272(2) test: other firearm, complainant 10` MEANS `s 272(2) facts` OF (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST TRUE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), 10
`s 272(2) test: firearm status not covered` MEANS `s 272(2) facts` OF (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), NOTHING, (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), 30
`s 272(2) test: restricted status not covered` MEANS `s 272(2) facts` OF NOTHING, (JUST FALSE), (JUST TRUE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), 30
`s 272(2) test: restricted firearm, subsequent not covered` MEANS `s 272(2) facts` OF (JUST TRUE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST TRUE), (JUST FALSE), NOTHING, 30
`s 272(2) test: other firearm, subsequent not covered` MEANS `s 272(2) facts` OF (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST TRUE), (JUST FALSE), NOTHING, 30
