§ `s 273.1: consent (lines 5108-5123)`

-- (2): no consent is obtained if any of (a) to (e). Field order of `s 273.1(2) facts`: other person's words, unconscious, otherwise incapable, abuse of trust, expresses lack of agreement, withdraws agreement
`s 273.1(2) test: agreement expressed by someone else` MEANS `s 273.1(2) facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`s 273.1(2) test: unconscious` MEANS `s 273.1(2) facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`s 273.1(2) test: incapable for another reason` MEANS `s 273.1(2) facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`s 273.1(2) test: abuse of trust` MEANS `s 273.1(2) facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`s 273.1(2) test: expresses lack of agreement` MEANS `s 273.1(2) facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE
`s 273.1(2) test: withdraws agreement` MEANS `s 273.1(2) facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE
`s 273.1(2) test: none of the listed circumstances` MEANS `s 273.1(2) facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
#ASSERT `s 273.1(2) no consent is obtained` `s 273.1(2) test: agreement expressed by someone else` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 273.1(2) no consent is obtained` `s 273.1(2) test: unconscious` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 273.1(2) no consent is obtained` `s 273.1(2) test: incapable for another reason` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 273.1(2) no consent is obtained` `s 273.1(2) test: abuse of trust` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 273.1(2) no consent is obtained` `s 273.1(2) test: expresses lack of agreement` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 273.1(2) no consent is obtained` `s 273.1(2) test: withdraws agreement` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (3): the list does not limit the circumstances, so none of (a) to (e) is not a no
#ASSERT `s 273.1(2) no consent is obtained` `s 273.1(2) test: none of the listed circumstances` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 273.1(3) subsection (2) is a limit on the circumstances in which no consent is obtained` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (1): consent is the voluntary agreement, subject to (2) and s 265(3)
